              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KR-Hive-NPC25_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "It took Morganthe many years of study to learn Shadow magic, and she quickly surpassed the Spider Magi who taught her.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Spider_Grandfather_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KH2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/OldCob_KH2_50.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1233438,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KR-Hive-NPC25_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Still, she was reluctant to share what she had learned, until her power bloomed with the infusion of a great rush of Death magic.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Spider_Grandfather_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KH2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/OldCob_KH2_51.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1233438,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "KR-Hive-NPC25_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Now that Morganthe is saturated with power, she hands it out easily to any who might defeat you. You should be honored. Hrum.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Spider_Grandfather_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KH2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/OldCob_KH2_52.mp3",
